    {
      "id": "yCnT",
      "code_hash": "8d4b821fb06790f03fd902c4dc3c54ed",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"squares\">Squares</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>marker=\"square\"</code> changes the shape. The sizes and the alpha values stay with each series.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "wlCL",
      "code_hash": "d9d5b4586691fcf04bee4a191a7fabdc",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "kqZH",
      "code_hash": "ed336cdd3f5755becf94577275b09595",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"other-markers\">Other markers</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>marker</code> chooses the shape. Names include <code>asterisk</code>, <code>circle</code>, <code>cross</code>, <code>diamond</code>, <code>diamond_cross</code>, <code>hex_dot</code>, <code>plus</code>, <code>square</code>, <code>square_x</code>, <code>star_dot</code>, and <code>triangle_pin</code>. The list is on the Bokeh scatter page: <a href=\"https://docs.bokeh.org/en/latest/docs/user_guide/basic/scatters.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.bokeh.org/en/latest/docs/user_guide/basic/scatters.html</a></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The first chart uses <code>diamond_cross</code>, <code>hex_dot</code>, and <code>square_x</code>. The legend names match those markers.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "wAgl",
      "code_hash": "cfa8ddf89aadfdfe8640b183c657aa3a",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rEll",
      "code_hash": "bdf544642a16f79c31added0636e48e0",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "dGlV",
      "code_hash": "34c35eedc2bff8dd782ccddb90917208",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"save-an-html-file\">Save an HTML file</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>output_file</code> names the file. <code>save</code> writes the line-and-circles figure into <code>Simple Line.html</code> in this folder. Open that file in a browser to see the chart by itself.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SdmI",
      "code_hash": "75b5fcf7d7d35aa767dd0d649f815cfc",
      "outputs": [],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "lgWD",
      "code_hash": "779870c12ce7e6c9ae7e57c3ae6bc37a",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"conclusions\">Conclusions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>figure</code> plus <code>line</code> draws the series <code>y</code> against <code>x</code>. <code>toolbar_location</code>, <code>width</code>, and <code>height</code> set the toolbar and the size.</li>\n<li><code>scatter</code> adds circles. <code>step</code> draws a staircase. Three <code>line</code> calls on one figure use color, dash, and a legend title to keep the series apart.</li>\n<li>A <code>NaN</code> in <code>x</code> breaks the line. The line continues after the next numeric x.</li>\n<li>Scatter size, <code>fill_alpha</code>, and <code>marker</code> change the points. The legend location, font, border, and background, and the title text and size, are properties of the figure.</li>\n<li><code>save</code> writes <code>Simple Line.html</code> for the line-and-circles figure.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "yOPj",
      "code_hash": "33a3ac52344dda966a50d38df711b088",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"check-your-understanding\">Check your understanding</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>What does <code>toolbar_location=\"above\"</code> change?</li>\n<li>Which two glyphs are on the chart titled Simple Line Graph that has a legend?</li>\n<li>How does <code>step</code> move from one point to the next?</li>\n<li>What happens to the three lines when <code>x1</code> is missing at indexes 2 and 6?</li>\n<li>On the circle chart, which series has the largest markers?</li>\n<li>What does <code>fill_alpha=0.2</code> do to a marker?</li>\n<li>What file does <code>save</code> write?</li>\n</ol></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
